=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"A6\" style=\"min-height:58px\"><span>Homeowners’<br>equity</span></li></ul><p class=\"ct\"><span data-count=\"6\" data-count-of=\"part-variables:A\">6 variables,</span> <span data-count=\"6\" data-count-of=\"part-inside:A\">6 connections inside</span></p></div><div class=\"wa-box\" data-part=\"B\" data-oa-part=\"pair\" data-lit=\"false\" style=\"left:303px;top:200px;width:196px;height:853px\"><p class=\"nm\">Voice</p><p class=\"q\">Who pays for influence?</p><p class=\"mt\">In our atlas: <span class=\"wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"title\">Political inputs</span></p><ul class=\"wa-pills\" aria-label=\"Variables in Voice\"><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B1\" style=\"min-height:58px\"><span>Money spent to<br>influence politics</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B2\" style=\"min-height:58px\"><span>Availability of<br>local reporting</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B3\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Civic ties across<br>social and<br>political groups</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B4\" style=\"min-height:66px\"><span>Hostility toward the<br>other political party</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B5\" style=\"min-height:58px\"><span>Equality of<br>voter turnout</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"B6\" style=\"min-height:58px\"><span>Exposure to hostile<br>political content</span></li></ul><p class=\"ct\"><span data-count=\"6\" data-count-of=\"part-variables:B\">6 variables,</span> <span data-count=\"5\" data-count-of=\"part-inside:B\">5 connections inside</span></p></div><div class=\"wa-box\" data-part=\"C\" data-lit=\"false\" style=\"left:558px;top:200px;width:196px;height:853px\"><p class=\"nm\">Elections</p><p class=\"q\">Who picks them?</p><p class=\"mt\">In our atlas: <span class=\"wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"title\">Electoral competition</span></p><ul class=\"wa-pills\" aria-label=\"Variables in Elections\"><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"C1\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Seats with<br>little electoral<br>competition</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"C2\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>How often the<br>primary decides<br>the winner</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"C3\" style=\"min-height:44px\"><span>Risk of losing office</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"C4\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Officeholders’<br>control over<br>election rules</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"C5\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Incumbents<br>defeated or pushed<br>into retirement</span></li></ul><p class=\"ct\"><span data-count=\"5\" data-count-of=\"part-variables:C\">5 variables,</span> <span data-count=\"5\" data-count-of=\"part-inside:C\">5 connections inside</span></p></div><div class=\"wa-box\" data-part=\"D\" data-lit=\"true\" style=\"left:813px;top:200px;width:196px;height:853px\"><p class=\"nm\">Checks</p><p class=\"q\">Who checks their work?</p><p class=\"mt\">In our atlas: <span class=\"wa-stored\" data-atlas-field=\"title\">Governing institutions</span></p><p class=\"lt\">The question you pressed reaches here</p><ul class=\"wa-pills\" aria-label=\"Variables in Checks\"><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"D1\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Congress’s<br>ability to write<br>and check policy</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"D2\" style=\"min-height:76px\"><span>Presidential<br>action without<br>new legislation</span></li><li class=\"wa-pill\" data-atlas-kind=\"Variable\" data-atlas-id=\"D3\" style=\"min-height:138px\"><span>Court rulings<br>favoring the<br>appoin